From cbe59d6e727e8a5586a64cc3fc5eafd504961baa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 09:26:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix GA4: correct measurement ID and run analytics on an
 opt-out basis

GA4 has never recorded a single session. Two compounding faults:

1. The tag was gated behind the cookie banner, which only faded in after
   1.4s. Cold paid traffic bounced before it appeared, so loadGA() almost
   never ran.
2. When it did run it reported to G-R3VB8DS79R, which is not a property in
   the connected Analytics account, so those hits were invisible anyway.

Changes:

- Point every page at G-58GH98HSHE (the property that actually exists).
  Removes the last reference to G-R3VB8DS79R, including the hardcoded one
  on thank-you.html.
- Run statistical analytics by default rather than behind an opt-in gate,
  relying on the statistical-purposes exception in PECR Schedule A1 as
  inserted by the Data (Use and Access) Act 2025. GA4 is locked to that
  basis: ad_storage, ad_user_data and ad_personalization all denied,
  allow_google_signals and allow_ad_personalization_signals false,
  anonymize_ip on.
- Give visitors the transparency and objection route the exception
  requires: a plain-English notice, a one-click opt-out, and a persistent
  "Analytics settings" link in the footer that reopens it. Opting out sets
  ga-disable and stops all further hits.
- Keep the OpenAI ads pixel and any advertising features strictly opt-in;
  they are not covered by the exception. Consent Mode is updated to
  granted only when the visitor explicitly allows ad measurement.
- RDH.track() now follows the analytics opt-out rather than ad consent, so
  the existing custom events fire for the whole audience.

Verified with headless Chromium against all six pages: tag loads
unprompted with the new ID, pixel stays dark until explicit opt-in, an
opted-out visitor sends nothing at all, and the footer link reopens the
notice.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012N4WsaGBgjtbbFZGW34AgP
